#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Identity gate**\n"
msgstr "**Identity gate**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The identity gate (sometimes called the Id or the I gate) is actually the "
"absence of a gate. It ensures that nothing is applied to a qubit for one "
"unit of gate time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang identity gate (tinatawag din minsan na Id o I gate) ay talagang kawalan "
"ng isang gate. Tinitiyak nito na walang inilalapat sa isang qubit sa loob ng"
" isang yunit ng gate time.\n"

