#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**S gate**\n"
msgstr "**S gate**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The S gate applies a phase of $i$ to the $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$ state. It"
" is equivalent to RZ for the angle $\\pi/2$. Note that S=P($\\pi/2$).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang S gate ay naglalapat ng phase na $i$ sa $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$ na "
"estado. Ito ay katumbas ng RZ para sa angle na $\\pi/2$. Tandaan na "
"S=P($\\pi/2$).\n"

