#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Phase gate**\n"
msgstr "**Phase gate**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Phase gate (previously called the U1 gate) applies a phase of "
"$e^{i\\theta}$ to the $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$ state. For certain values of"
" $\\theta$, it is equivalent to other gates. For example, P($\\pi$)=Z, "
"P($\\pi$/$2$)=S, and P($\\pi/4$)=T. Up to a global phase of "
"$e^{i\\theta/2}$, it is equivalent to RZ($\\theta$).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Phase gate (dating tinatawag na U1 gate) ay naglalapat ng phase na "
"$e^{i\\theta}$ sa $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$ na estado. Para sa ilang halaga "
"ng $\\theta$, katumbas ito ng ibang mga gate. Halimbawa, P($\\pi$)=Z, "
"P($\\pi$/$2$)=S, at P($\\pi/4$)=T. Sa global phase na $e^{i\\theta/2}$, "
"katumbas ito ng RZ($\\theta$).\n"

