"In IBM Quantum Composer, the default value for `angle` is $\\pi/2$. "
"Therefore, this is the angle used in the q-sphere visualization.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa IBM Quantum Composer, ang default na halaga para sa `angle` ay $\\pi/2$. "
"Kaya naman ito ang angle na ginagamit sa q-sphere visualization.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Non-unitary operators and modifiers {#non-unitary-operators-and-modifiers}"
msgstr ""
"Mga Non-Unitary Operator at Modifier {#non-unitary-operators-and-modifiers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Reset operation**\n"
msgstr "**Reset Operation**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The reset operation returns a qubit to state $\\left|0\\right\\rangle$, "
"irrespective of its state before the operation was applied. It is not a "
"reversible operation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang reset operation ay nagbabalik ng qubit sa estado ng "
"$\\left|0\\right\\rangle$, anuman ang estado nito bago mailapat ang "
"operasyon. Hindi ito isang reversible na operasyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Composer reference                          | OpenQASM reference |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![0-opera](/docs/images/guides/composer/6a1605ff-fb88-4bf7-ac81-43b0cce918c9.avif) | `reset q[0];`      |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Sanggunian sa Composer                          | Sanggunian sa OpenQASM |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![0-opera](/docs/images/guides/composer/6a1605ff-fb88-4bf7-ac81-43b0cce918c9.avif) | `reset q[0];`      |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Measurement**\n"
msgstr "**Measurement**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Measurement in the standard basis, also known as the z basis or "
"computational basis. Can be used to implement any kind of measurement when "
"combined with gates. It is not a reversible operation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagsukat sa standard basis, na kilala rin bilang z basis o computational "
"basis. Maaaring gamitin para ipatupad ang anumang uri ng pagsukat kapag "
"pinagsama sa mga gate. Hindi ito isang reversible na operasyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Composer reference                                       | OpenQASM reference |\n"
"| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![Measurement in the standard or z basis](/docs/images/guides/composer/9fca7f1e-ba46-400d-a3d1-312ee011d705.avif) | `measure q[0];`    |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Sanggunian sa Composer                                       | Sanggunian sa OpenQASM |\n"
"| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![Pagsukat sa standard o z basis](/docs/images/guides/composer/9fca7f1e-ba46-400d-a3d1-312ee011d705.avif) | `measure q[0];`    |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Control modifier**\n"
msgstr "**Control Modifier**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A control modifier yields a gate whose original operation is now contingent "
"on the state of the control qubit. When the control is in the $|1\\rangle$ "
"state, the target qubit(s) undergo the specified unitary evolution. In "
"contrast, no operation is performed if the control is in the $|0\\rangle$ "
"state. If the control is in a superposition state, then the resulting "
"operation follows from linearity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang control modifier ay nagbubunga ng isang gate kung saan ang orihinal na "
"operasyon nito ay nakasalalay na ngayon sa estado ng control qubit. Kapag "
"ang control ay nasa $|1\\rangle$ na estado, ang target na qubit(s) ay "
"sumasailalim sa tinukoy na unitary evolution. Sa kabilang banda, walang "
"operasyon na isinasagawa kung ang control ay nasa $|0\\rangle$ na estado. "
"Kung ang control ay nasa superposition state, ang nagresultang operasyon ay "
"sumusunod mula sa linearidad.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Drag the control modifier to a gate in order to add a control to it. Dots "
"will appear above and below the gate, on the qubit wires that can be targets"
" that control; click one or more dots to assign the target to one or more "
"qubits. You can also assign a control by right-clicking a gate.\n"
msgstr ""
"I-drag ang control modifier sa isang gate para magdagdag ng control dito. "
"Lilitaw ang mga tuldok sa itaas at ibaba ng gate, sa mga qubit wire na "
"maaaring maging mga target na control; mag-click ng isa o higit pang tuldok "
"para italaga ang target sa isa o higit pang qubit. Maaari ka ring mag-assign"
" ng control sa pamamagitan ng right-click sa isang gate.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To remove a control, right-click the gate and select the option to remove "
"control.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para alisin ang isang control, right-click ang gate at piliin ang opsyon "
"para alisin ang control.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Composer reference                                          | OpenQASM reference |\n"
"| ----------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![Control modifier](/docs/images/guides/composer/243c0fad-8236-4b03-a71a-bacaed4055c8.avif) | `c`                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Sanggunian sa Composer                                          | Sanggunian sa OpenQASM |\n"
"| ----------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![Control modifier](/docs/images/guides/composer/243c0fad-8236-4b03-a71a-bacaed4055c8.avif) | `c`                |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Barrier operation**\n"
msgstr "**Barrier Operation**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To make your quantum program more efficient, the compiler will try to "
"combine gates. The barrier is an instruction to the compiler to prevent "
"these combinations being made. Additionally, it is useful for "
"visualizations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para gawing mas mahusay ang iyong quantum program, susubukan ng compiler na "
"pagsamahin ang mga gate. Ang barrier ay isang tagubilin sa compiler para "
"pigilan ang mga kombinasyong ito na gawin. Bukod pa rito, ito ay kapaki-"
"pakinabang para sa mga visualization.\n"

