#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**$\\sqrt{X}^{\\dagger}$ gate**\n"
msgstr "**$\\sqrt{X}^{\\dagger}$ gate**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Also known as the SXdg or square-root NOT-dagger gate.\n"
msgstr "Kilala rin bilang SXdg o square-root NOT-dagger gate.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is the inverse of the $\\sqrt{X}$ gate. Applying it twice in a row "
"produces the Pauli-X gate (NOT gate), since the NOT gate is its own inverse."
" Like the $\\sqrt{X}$ gate, this gate can be used to create an equal "
"superposition state, and it too is natively implemented on some hardwares "
"using an X90 pulse.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ito ang inverse ng $\\sqrt{X}$ gate. Ang paglalapat nito nang dalawang beses"
" nang sunod-sunod ay nagbubunga ng Pauli-X gate (NOT gate), dahil ang NOT "
"gate ay sarili nitong inverse. Tulad ng $\\sqrt{X}$ gate, ang gate na ito ay"
" maaaring gamitin para lumikha ng pantay na superposition state, at ito rin "
"ay native na ipinapatupad sa ilang hardware gamit ang X90 pulse.\n"

