#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Y gate**\n"
msgstr "**Y gate**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Pauli Y gate is equivalent to Ry for the angle $\\pi$. It is equivalent "
"to applying X and Z, up to a global phase factor.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Pauli Y gate ay katumbas ng Ry para sa angle na $\\pi$. Katumbas ito ng "
"paglalapat ng X at Z, hanggang sa isang global phase factor.\n"

