#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**RXX gate**\n"
msgstr "**RXX gate**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The RXX gate implements $\\exp(-i \\theta/2 X \\otimes X)$. The "
"Mølmer–Sørensen gate, the native gate on ion-trap systems, can be expressed "
"as a sum of RXX gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang RXX gate ay nagpapatupad ng $\\exp(-i \\theta/2 X \\otimes X)$. Ang "
"Mølmer–Sørensen gate, ang native gate sa mga ion-trap system, ay maaaring "
"ipahayag bilang isang kabuuan ng mga RXX gate.\n"

