#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**RC3X gate**\n"
msgstr "**RC3X gate**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The simplified 3-controlled Toffoli gate.\n"
msgstr "Ang simplified 3-controlled Toffoli gate.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The simplified Toffoli gate implements the Toffoli gate up to relative "
"phases. Note that the simplified Toffoli is not equivalent to the Toffoli, "
"but can be used in places where the Toffoli gate is uncomputed again.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang simplified Toffoli gate ay nagpapatupad ng Toffoli gate hanggang sa mga "
"relatibong phase. Tandaan na ang simplified Toffoli ay hindi katumbas ng "
"Toffoli, ngunit maaaring gamitin sa mga lugar kung saan ang Toffoli gate ay "
"muling nire-uncomputeado.\n"

